    "index": 2,
    "sentence": "Then\n$$ S = \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\left( 3 \\cdot \\frac{\\ln(4k+2)}{4k+2} - \\frac{\\ln(4k+3)}{4k+3} - \\frac{\\ln(4k+4)}{4k+4} - \\frac{\\ln(4k+5)}{4k+5} \\right) .$$\nWe can rewrite this sum as\n\\begin{align*} S &= \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\int_0^1 \\left( 3 x^{4k+1} - x^{4k+2} - x^{4k+3} - x^{4k+4} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty \\left( 3 x^{4k+1} - x^{4k+2} - x^{4k+3} - x^{4k+4} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\left( 3x \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty x^{4k} - x^2 \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty x^{4k} - x^3 \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty x^{4k} - x^4 \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty x^{4k} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\sum_{k=0}^\\infty x^{4k} (3x - x^2 - x^3 - x^4) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{3x - x^2 - x^3 - x^4}{1 - x^4} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - x - x^2 - x^3)}{1 - x^4} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - x - x^2 - x^3)}{(1 - x)(1 + x + x^2 + x^3)} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - x - x^2 - x^3)}{(1 - x)(1 + x + x^2 + x^3)} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - (x + x^2 + x^3))}{(1 - x)(1 + x + x^2 + x^3)} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - (1 + x + x^2 + x^3) + 1)}{1 - x^4} dx = \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - \\frac{1 - x^4}{1 - x} + 1)}{1 - x^4} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(4 - \\frac{1 - x^4}{1 - x})}{1 - x^4} dx = \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(4(1 - x) - (1 - x^4))}{(1 - x^4)(1 - x)} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(4 - 4x - 1 + x^4)}{(1 - x^4)(1 - x)} dx = \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - 4x + x^4)}{(1 - x)(1 + x + x^2 + x^3)} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{3x - 4x^2 + x^5}{1 - x^4} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\left( \\frac{3x - 4x^2 + x^5}{1 - x^4} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\left( \\frac{x^5 - 4x^2 + 3x}{1 - x^4} \\right) dx = \\int_0^1 \\left( -x + \\frac{-4x^2 + 4x}{1 - x^4} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\left( -x + \\frac{4x(1 - x)}{1 - x^4} \\right) dx = \\int_0^1 \\left( -x + \\frac{4x(1 - x)}{(1 - x)(1 + x + x^2 + x^3)} \\right) dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\left( -x + \\frac{4x}{1 + x + x^2 + x^3} \\right) dx = \\int_0^1 \\frac{-x - x^2 - x^3 - x^4 + 4x}{1 + x + x^2 + x^3} dx \\\\ &= \\int_0^1 \\frac{3x - x^2 - x^3 - x^4}{1 + x + x^2 + x^3} dx = \\int_0^1 \\frac{x(3 - x - x^2 - x^3)}{1 + x + x^2 + x^3} dx .",
